>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. SOURCE-CATALOG-TESTS.

DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 WS-ACTION PIC X(12).
01 WS-KIND PIC X(8).
01 WS-INDEX PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-VERSION PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-TEXT PIC X(96).
01 WS-STATUS PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-I PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 WS-CUTLET-EXPECTED.
   05 WS-CUTLET-NAME OCCURS 17 TIMES PIC X(96).
01 WS-MONTH-EXPECTED.
   05 WS-MONTH-NAME OCCURS 47 TIMES PIC X(96).
01 LOCAL-RUN PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.
01 LOCAL-FAILED PIC 9(4) COMP-5 VALUE 0.

LINKAGE SECTION.
01 LK-RUN PIC 9(4) COMP-5.
01 LK-FAILED PIC 9(4) COMP-5.

PROCEDURE DIVISION USING LK-RUN LK-FAILED.
MAIN.
    PERFORM LOAD-EXPECTED
    MOVE "VALIDATE" TO WS-ACTION
    MOVE SPACES TO WS-KIND WS-TEXT
    MOVE 0 TO WS-INDEX WS-VERSION WS-STATUS
    CALL "SOURCE-LANGUAGE-CATALOG" USING WS-ACTION WS-KIND WS-INDEX WS-VERSION WS-TEXT WS-STATUS
    ADD 1 TO LOCAL-RUN
    IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 OR WS-VERSION NOT = 1
        ADD 1 TO LOCAL-FAILED
        DISPLAY "失败: SourceLanguageCatalog 自检或版本不正确。"
    END-IF

    MOVE "GET" TO WS-ACTION
    MOVE "CUTLET" TO WS-KIND
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 17
        MOVE WS-I TO WS-INDEX
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-TEXT
        MOVE 0 TO WS-STATUS
        CALL "SOURCE-LANGUAGE-CATALOG" USING WS-ACTION WS-KIND WS-INDEX WS-VERSION WS-TEXT WS-STATUS
        ADD 1 TO LOCAL-RUN
        IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 OR FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TEXT) NOT = FUNCTION TRIM(WS-CUTLET-NAME(WS-I))
            ADD 1 TO LOCAL-FAILED
            DISPLAY "失败: 肉饼 canonicalIndex 映射不正确: " WS-I
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM

    MOVE "MONTH" TO WS-KIND
    PERFORM VARYING WS-I FROM 1 BY 1 UNTIL WS-I > 47
        MOVE WS-I TO WS-INDEX
        MOVE SPACES TO WS-TEXT
        MOVE 0 TO WS-STATUS
        CALL "SOURCE-LANGUAGE-CATALOG" USING WS-ACTION WS-KIND WS-INDEX WS-VERSION WS-TEXT WS-STATUS
        ADD 1 TO LOCAL-RUN
        IF WS-STATUS NOT = 0 OR FUNCTION TRIM(WS-TEXT) NOT = FUNCTION TRIM(WS-MONTH-NAME(WS-I))
            ADD 1 TO LOCAL-FAILED
            DISPLAY "失败: 月份 canonicalIndex 映射不正确: " WS-I
        END-IF
    END-PERFORM

    ADD LOCAL-RUN TO LK-RUN
    ADD LOCAL-FAILED TO LK-FAILED
    GOBACK.

LOAD-EXPECTED.
    MOVE "青铜" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(1)
    MOVE "狐狸" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(2)
    MOVE "肾脏" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(3)
    MOVE "拉格什" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(4)
    MOVE "思想" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(5)
    MOVE "九分之四" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(6)
    MOVE "帕尔古拉什" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(7)
    MOVE "莎草" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(8)
    MOVE "簇" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(9)
    MOVE "蝎子" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(10)
    MOVE "灰烬" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(11)
    MOVE "小麦" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(12)
    MOVE "河流" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(13)
    MOVE "笑声" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(14)
    MOVE "阿卡德" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(15)
    MOVE "角" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(16)
    MOVE "空罐" TO WS-CUTLET-NAME(17)

    MOVE "黏土" TO WS-MONTH-NAME(1)
    MOVE "石榴" TO WS-MONTH-NAME(2)
    MOVE "肘部" TO WS-MONTH-NAME(3)
    MOVE "嫉妒" TO WS-MONTH-NAME(4)
    MOVE "埃里都" TO WS-MONTH-NAME(5)
    MOVE "牙膏" TO WS-MONTH-NAME(6)
